    "readTime": "Practical guide",
    "description_en": "Character consistency starts with deciding what must survive a redraw. A convincing new atmosphere is not enough if the hairstyle, costume or face no longer identifies the character. Define those anchors before judging the new style.",
    "description_cn": "角色一致性要从改图前决定：哪些特征一变，这张图就不能用了。光线和质感可以更合心意，但如果发型、衣服构造或脸的关系变了，画面再漂亮，也不能直接当作原角色的新版本。",
